index 23e4fae..3e50b9a 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -14,6 +14,10 @@ its date, and the options it was priced with (`code`, `pickup`):
   "items": [{ "sku": "BEANS-1KG", "name": "House beans 1kg", "unitPrice": 2400, "qty": 1 }] }
 ```
 
+An order may also carry a `note`, the customer's delivery instructions, up to 200 characters. The
+receipt prints it as its last line (`Note: Leave it at the side door`) so the packers see it, and
+`price-order --json` includes it; the invoice leaves it out.
+
 `validateOrder` names every problem with an order; the CLIs refuse an order that has any.
 
 ## Pricing rules
